OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome long clear spells, allowing areas
OL,7,Fof mist and fog to develop. A little
OL,8,Fmore breezy in the far north, perhaps
OL,9,Flimiting fog amounts here. A cool
OL,10,Fnight for most.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FOnce fog clears during Monday
OL,13,Fmorning, dry and feeling very warm by
OL,14,Fafternoon, with sunny spells. Rather
OL,15,Fcloudier across more northern areas at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
