OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight fog clearing Tuesday
OL,7,Fmorning, then another fine day.
OL,8,FProbably wet Wednesday with some
OL,9,Fthundery bursts of rain. Cooler
OL,10,FThursday and mostly dry with sunny
OL,11,Fspells. Showers in the northeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
